From 053ecab65af38297f119a447359bdd21d44689bb Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2026 14:04:11 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] AIM #179: vsetky panely UI v SET_PANELS, posun a zoom panelov

Zoznam panelov pre chat je odvodeny z WORKSPACE_PANELS (aimPanelList.ts), nie z rucneho zoznamu:
BCF topics (Alt+3) a dalsie panely sa daju otvorit, zavriet a prepnut, view_state ich vypise
vsetky s domovom a klavesovou skratkou. SCROLL_PANEL dostal panel, item a percent, nova
sprava ZOOM_PANEL. renderPanelBody znaci panel data-aim-panel (blok AIM-FORK).
